- The project only has integration tests, and they are written in the tests directory at the root of the project
- For the tests to work correctly, the Unit settings from the external system, env.json, schema.json, etc. must be specified
- All tests are built on the principle of one test per check and atomic
- Tests should use fixtures to the maximum extent possible
- Tests should cover every method of the PepeunitClient class.